mped, the yen sank to 160: the lean holds, the extreme case still waits.|Oil rallied and markets got jumpier: a mixed night for this pair.|Two safe havens, one at Tokyo's red line, and still no clear winner.|Gold's three-day slide hit its lowest since October 2025, then bounced in Asia.")
